# drag options: Shift constrains the selection to a square; the right button paints
# with colour 2 (white on white: the image stays unchanged but undo gets a step)
click #1107
drag 300,300 500,420 8 shift
expect text:"120 × 120px" exists
key esc
click #1106
drag 300,300 500,420 8 right
expect #10 enabled
